== Research
My research interests include 
- Wireless Communication and Sensing
- Artificial Intelligence 
- Compressive Sensing  
- Machine Learning
~~~
My research interests lie in the broad area of *6G wireless communication, sensing and artificial intelligence of things (AIoT)*. My current research focuses on the design of machine learning algorithms and signal processing algorithms with  applications to wireless communications and sensing, and *building practical systems to support real-world applications* on top of it. 
In particular, my research develops a coherent framework spanning MuSAC, foundation-model-based wireless intelligence, LLM-enabled AIoT systems, data-efficient learning (active, continual, and distributed), non-invasive/passive sensing, near-field sensing, with an emphasis on developing principled and theoretically grounded high-dimensional signal processing and optimization methods for next-generation wireless systems. 

# My research interests lie in the broad area of *6G wireless communication, sensing and artificial intelligence*. My current research focuses on the design of machine learning algorithms and signal processing algorithms with applications to wireless communications and sensing, and *building practical systems to support real-world applications* on top of it. In particular, current works include mutualistic sensing and communication (MuSAC), intelligent communication and sensing (ICAS), near-field sensing, semantic communication, distributed learning, deep learning based high-dimensional signal processing and large-scale optimization.
~~~


